<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Every URL here must exist, and every page that exists must be here.
  test/verify.seo.mjs walks the filesystem and fails the build if the two lists differ,
  so this file cannot rot quietly.

  Not listed, on purpose:
    /404.html   — an error page; it carries <meta name="robots" content="noindex">.

  /compress/ is owned by a separate agent (the image-compressor tool). It is listed
  here so it is crawled from launch; its index.html may land after this file.

  SITE ORIGIN: this file hardcodes the domain 15 times (sitemaps require absolute URLs).
  Moving domains means find-and-replacing it here too — see README.md, "Moving domains".
-->
